            "block_content": "SECTION 13.10.1. Any regular employee who is granted a leave of absence to enter the military service of the United States and is re-employed under Section 13.10 hereof shall be entitled to vacation based on his/her accredited service with the Company. Such vacation to be granted in accordance with the provisions of Article 11, Section 11.1.",
