        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 14.2.2. A hearing aid benefit will be added to the Company sponsored Medical Plan. This benefit will provide coverage for expenses for a hearing examination by a licensed audiologist or physician, the hearing aid device, molds, repairs, hearing aid check and batteries. The maximum reimbursement under this benefit is $1,000 per covered individual every 24 months. The benefit is not subject to deductible, co-pays or R&C and there are no separate maximums for any in or out of network expenses. Hearing aids are covered for all hearing impairments that are a result of birth defects, illness, accidents and/or injury and progressive loss of hearing. Replacement and repair of hearing aids are covered unless due to misuse or loss.",
            "block_bbox": [
                270,
                847,
                1064,
                1185
            ],
