            "block_content": "SECTION 14.2.3. Eligible surviving spouses, dependents and registered domestic partners (RDP) of an active employee who participates in a Company sponsored Medical Plan, shall be provided with medical coverage at no charge for twenty-four (24) months following the death of the employee.",
